 "notes": [
  "TITLE WITHHELD: the published title 'Let's Hear It For Boobies' is a breast joke.",
  "Qty 61 as published (no section counts given). The 8 cards under 'Starting' count toward the total; several Effects start (Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points, Power Of The Hutt), so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Come Here You Big Coward and Oppressive Enforcement are the Special Edition Effects (the Reflections III Defensive Shields of the same names came later).",
  "Posted 'Prepared Defences' dested Prepared Defenses; 'Endor Landing Platform' Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay); 'U-3P0' U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Chimerra' Chimaera; 'Zuchuss In Mist Hunter' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter; 'Boba Fett In Slave 1' Boba Fett In Slave I; 'Sullist' Sullust; 'Admeral Ozzel' Admiral Ozzel; Point Man and Sense are the Dark Interrupts.",
  "The author's update (adding Imperial Decree; Perimeter Patrol to come in) is not applied; dested as posted. The post says the deck 'is tearing up the Ohio tournament scene' and credits brainstorming with Jamie Abel; no event is named."
 ],
